      "modifications": "Three-pane composition and selected coherent CSS rule families; direct sash/swipe algorithms; props narrowed to task/run data. Add keyboard focus/inert drawers/44px controls. Delete composer, PTY, plugin slots, filesystem tree and model/provider administration. Correct open-drawer drag offset."
