      ],
      "modifications": "Direct tree/collapse/orphan traversal; board expand/edit/add/delete/copy composition. Replace checkbox outcomes and prompt/clean-handoff dispatch with local Assignment drafts, explicit dependency selection and preflight actions. Real current/graph metadata drives finite proof continuation and portable prospective proposals; exact post-await current revalidation and separate explicit Save/Generate/Start. Proposals are not retained membership."
