      ],
      "modifications": "Direct Markdown/math/highlight/code-lines and streaming segmentation/smoothing modules. Remove executable fence/widget registration and pi-file paths. Safe link policy; omit images/media; optional raw HTML sanitized before nontrusted KaTeX/highlighting. Copy fallback restores focus and removes temporary DOM in finally. Streaming renderer is ported, not a claim of a live-text channel absent from current service projections."
