      "modifications": "Direct ToC/slug and SCM renderDiff, preview raw/Markdown/line-range/zoom composition. Bind only to retained content; page-local line numbers and captured-versus-current coverage explicit. No file editor, arbitrary host paths, HTML iframe/script enablement, attachments, Git stage/reset/commit or shell. Native checks/human review come from shared facts."
    },
