        "web/src/timeline/timeline-adapter.ts",
        "web/src/timeline/TimelineView.tsx",
        "web/src/timeline/timeline.css"
      ],
      "modifications": "Direct whole standalone DOM client, not a replacement chart: lanes/list/four detail tabs/filter/zoom/follow/replay/resize/dispose retained. Finite typed read bridge instead of plugin send. Only pinned local vis import/CSS. Remove clear-history, CDN fallback, private redraw, external plugin update messages and active-window inference. Page ordinal/committed sequence visual axis; no browser clock extension of native spans, model-text timing, inferred file-change analysis or execution replay. Serial revision removes dormant live-clock/idle/prose analysis, reports missing vendor as degraded, shows recorded clock domains, and externalizes all 15 exact pinned vendor CSS literals."
    },
