        "web/src/components/actions/ReceiptPanel.tsx"
      ],
      "modifications": "Adapt stale-socket generation/bounded reconnect and immutable same-entity append algorithm. Shared ProjectionTracker alone reduces execution projections; no copied upstream UiState/schema. Native dialog/focus replaces extension response sender. Finite preflight/named command/cancel/exact receipt; no automatic action retry or confirmation renewal. Disconnect/Return detaches, not Cancel."
